                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While not a hunter myself I can appreciate AWS being one of the only simulators that dont sacrifice substance over style, as a gamer I often found myself looking for hub elements only to reallize \"in reality it would be like this\", while it does gamify certain aspects such as score, time and challenges the game is designed to give  a realistic experience, things like minimal hub, counting the bullets after reloading, the lighting and different duck calls puts the whole experience together.",
